# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan Revision Update Improvements<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
<br>
As part of our ongoing effort to create a more sustainable fashion industry, we are revising our research plan to focus on The Ordinary&#x27;s clinical formulations with integrity. This includes exploring natural ingredients, eco-friendly packaging, and socially responsible manufacturing practices.<br>
<br>
## Methodology<br>
<br>
We will conduct an in-depth analysis of the current state of sustainable fashion, including trends, challenges, and opportunities for growth. We will also examine existing literature on The Ordinary&#x27;s clinical formulations and their impact on the environment.<br>
<br>
## Expected Outcomes<br>
<br>
Our revised research plan aims to provide a comprehensive understanding of sustainable fashion practices and identify areas for improvement. We expect to develop recommendations for incorporating natural ingredients, eco-friendly packaging, and socially responsible manufacturing practices into our own business operations.<br>
<br>
## Timeline<br>
<br>
* Week 1-2: Conduct literature review on The Ordinary&#x27;s clinical formulations and their impact on the environment.<br>
* Week 3-4: Analyze existing sustainable fashion practices and identify areas for improvement.<br>
* Week 5-6: Develop recommendations for incorporating natural ingredients, eco-friendly packaging, and socially responsible manufacturing practices into our own business operations.<br>
<br>
